## Per-Explainer Aesthetic Guardrails
- **Swiss End-to-End (`end-to-end-swiss`) — Low-Fidelity Flowing Narrative**:
  - *Protect:* Preserve its calm, uncluttered orthographic flow, readable typography, and enjoyable 4:38 narration cadence.
  - *Avoid:* Do NOT bolt complex 3D multi-lane tubing, floating math sandboxes, or dense equation controls onto the main Swiss stage.
  - *Preferred Lever:* Narration & verbiage precision + subtle axis/margin layout fixes
- **Beamline (`end-to-end-beamline`) — High-Detail Multi-Angle Pipeline**:
  - *Protect:* Amplify rich 3D camera angles, architectural station detail, and step-by-step depth for engaged viewers.
  - *Avoid:* Do NOT flatten its rich 3D choreography—instead isolate dense equations & interactive probes inside a clean Study mode.
  - *Preferred Lever:* Watch/Study separation + multi-angle 3D fidelity + deeper interactive specs
- **Journey Story (`journey-story`) — Component-Level Functional Anatomy**:
  - *Protect:* Make every individual component’s blueprint SVG and 3D cutaway clearly translate that component’s mathematical job.
  - *Avoid:* Do NOT let 3D rooms cover blueprint SVGs or flatten per-component math into generic flowcharts.
  - *Preferred Lever:* Zero SVG occlusion + component-to-math graphic fidelity + docked micro-labs
- **Guided Tour (`journey-tour`) — Guided Component Museum Walk**:
  - *Protect:* Keep every stop exhibition-clean with a dedicated camera pose encapsulating one component’s role and effortless keyboard flow.
  - *Avoid:* Do NOT reuse static poses across distinct stops or clutter the centered 3D apparatus with heavy sidebars.
  - *Preferred Lever:* Distinct per-stop camera angles + seamless iframe keyboard bridging + plaque layout
- **obs-core Engine (`obs-core`) — Shared Mechanical Component Engine**:
  - *Protect:* Encode exact DeepSeek-V4-Pro cardinality (384 uniform slots, 4-stream mHC, 61 layers) while maintaining 0-frame idle sleeping.
  - *Avoid:* Do NOT add semantic "topic chute" colors or introduce always-on animation loops that regress battery/WARP performance.
